Joe Wells (jbw@bigbird.bu.edu) wrote:
: Hello NetHack Gurus,

: I have just fetched and compiled NetHack 3.1.  My life is now complete.
: However, I have a number of comments and questions, mainly about the new
: X11 interface.

: 1. How do you specify which window interface to use dynamically?  I have
:    to resort to editing the binary to switch between "tty" and "X11".

First you compile in both.  Then set tty as the default.  Then in
NETHACKOPTIONS environment variable put in windowtype:X11 or
windowtype:tty.  Works for me.

